<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN 1ST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN 1ST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard of the fourth day of</p>
<p>the first test between Sri Lanka and Pakistan on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings 330</p>
<p>Pakistan first innings  378</p>
<p>Sri Lanka second innings:</p>
<p> M.Atapattu c Nazir b Saqlain		   25</p>
<p> R.Arnold c Nazir b Saqlain		     15</p>
<p> A. de Silva not out				79</p>
<p> A. Ranatunga c Rameez b Mushtaq		58</p>
<p> H. Tillekeratne not out			  20</p>
<p> Extras (lb-4, nb-5)				 9</p>
<p>Total (for 3 wickets at close, 80 overs)  206</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-38 2-53 3-182</p>
<p>Bowling: Zahid 8-1-37-0; Nazir 6-0-33-0; Saqlain 28-7-52-2;</p>
<p>Mushtaq 23-6-47-1; Mujtaba 15-3-33-0</p>
